{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011Cd9yUAqKjY2PZVbSv7tFU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018GqNvn6Vq3qWpVEsc6JnMe","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"W4: authors pages + api/authors","prompt":"You are workstream W4 building everything author-related in \"Ma Bibliothèque\", a French-language personal library app. Work ONLY inside /Users/tom/Documents/my-library/app (Next.js 16 App Router, src dir, Tailwind v4, shadcn/ui radix-nova style, TypeScript strict).\n\n## Context — read these files FIRST (frozen contracts, DO NOT MODIFY):\n- src/db/schema.ts + src/db/index.ts (drizzle db, tables, types Author, AuthorWithCount, Book)\n- src/lib/validation.ts (authorInputSchema, authorUpdateSchema, PERIODS, enums)\n- src/lib/normalize.ts (normalizeText, normalizeKey, formatYear, formatLifespan)\n- src/lib/queries.ts (listAuthors with AuthorFilters, getAuthor — returns author + books, countBooksByAuthor, getFilterOptions)\n- app/AGENTS.md: this Next.js version has breaking changes; `params`/`searchParams` in pages AND route handlers are Promises you must await. Consult node_modules/next/dist/docs/ if unsure.\n\nFixture data: data/library.db has 5 authors / 8 books. Later: 400–800 authors.\n\n## Your deliverables\n\n### A. API (zod-validated, French errors, JSON)\n- src/app/api/authors/route.ts:\n  - GET: optional query params (search, mainField, mainGenre, period, nationality, language) → {authors: listAuthors(filters)} (each row has bookCount).\n  - POST: authorInputSchema; compute nameNormalized via normalizeKey(normalizeText(name)); 201 {author}; 409 {error:\"Cet auteur existe déjà\"} if nameNormalized duplicate.\n- src/app/api/authors/[id]/route.ts:\n  - GET → {author} incl. books via getAuthor, 404 {error:\"Auteur introuvable\"}.\n  - PUT: authorUpdateSchema (recompute nameNormalized if name changes), 200 {author}, 404, 409 on dup name.\n  - DELETE: if countBooksByAuthor(id) > 0 → 409 {error:\"Impossible de supprimer : des livres sont rattachés à cet auteur\", bookCount}; else delete → 200 {ok:true}; 404 if missing.\n\n### B. Pages (French UI)\n- REPLACE placeholder src/app/auteurs/page.tsx — server component (`export const dynamic = \"force-dynamic\"`) loading listAuthors() + getFilterOptions(), rendering client component src/components/authors/authors-view.tsx: search input (accent-insensitive, client-side via normalizeKey) + filter popovers (Domaine=mainField, Genre principal=mainGenre, Période, Nationalité, Langue — multi-select with badge chips and \"Réinitialiser\") + a sortable table (plain shadcn Table or TanStack, your choice): Nom, Dates (formatLifespan), Nationalité, Langue, Genre principal, Domaine, Nb livres. Rows link to /auteurs/[id]. Header button \"Ajouter un auteur\" → /auteurs/nouveau. Empty state \"Aucun auteur ne correspond aux critères\".\n- src/app/auteurs/[id]/page.tsx — server component (`dynamic = \"force-dynamic\"`), getAuthor(Number(id)), notFound() if absent. Identity card: name, dates (formatLifespan — negative years are av. J.-C., helper handles it), nationality, langue, genre principal, domaine, période, notes. \"Biographie\" section: renders author.bio with react-markdown if present, else muted text \"Aucune biographie pour le moment — lancez une Analyse Claude depuis l'un de ses livres.\" Then \"Livres de cet auteur (N)\" list: each book title links to /livres/[id] with small badges (catégorie, période). Buttons \"Modifier\" → /auteurs/[id]/modifier and \"Supprimer\" via client AlertDialog component src/components/authors/delete-author-dialog.tsx calling DELETE (on 409 show the server error as toast with the bookCount; on success toast + router.push(\"/auteurs\")).\n- src/app/auteurs/nouveau/page.tsx + src/app/auteurs/[id]/modifier/page.tsx rendering:\n- src/components/authors/author-form.tsx — client, react-hook-form + zodResolver: Nom (required), Année de naissance / Année de décès (number Inputs, negative = av. J.-C., helper text \"Année négative = av. J.-C.\"), Nationalité, Langue, Genre principal, Domaine principal (mainField), Période (Select PERIODS + \"—\"), Notes (Textarea). POST/PUT to API, French toasts, redirect to detail.\n\n### C. Constraints\n- Your namespace: src/app/api/authors/**, src/app/auteurs/**, src/components/authors/**. DO NOT create or modify anything under src/app/livres, src/app/api/books, src/components/books (other agents own those; /livres/[id] links will resolve later).\n- DO NOT modify: src/db/*, src/lib/*, layout, main-nav, package.json, next.config.ts.\n- All needed shadcn ui components are in src/components/ui.\n- Verify: `cd /Users/tom/Documents/my-library/app && npx tsc --noEmit` zero errors. You MAY smoke-test your API with `npm run dev -- --port 3104` + curl (kill the server afterwards!). DO NOT run `npm run build`. Do not commit.\n\nReport back: files created, tsc result, curl smoke-test results if performed, deviations."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4471,"cache_read_input_tokens":98106,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4471},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"893f4819-6d94-4f67-849d-3e57eeca4b35","uuid":"47b55d84-edc1-4774-b703-d81d54e53abe","timestamp":"2026-07-18T18:13:57.138Z","request_id":"req_011Cd9yU53ZnKDRF6aPFKgx2"}
