erged into another book, or listed in \"dropped\" with a reason. Apply your literary/historical knowledge for canonical French titles, typo fixes, and metadata. When done run: python3 /Users/tom/Documents/my-library/pipeline/validate_chunk.py /Users/tom/Documents/my-library/pipeline/output/cleaned/chunk-07.json — and fix any errors until it prints OK. Report: author/book/dropped counts and your 5 most notable decisions.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-tom-Documents-my-library/893f4819-6d94-4f67-849d-3e57eeca4b35/tasks/a2b988b4ca5974240.output","canReadOutputFile":true}}
